{"4734020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wreckreation 2", "steam_appid": 4734020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wreckreation 2 is an open-world arcade racing game where every Slam, every Shortcut and every Takedown can change the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734020/extras/bfe234f9c20fd9d663cedd4d25825513.avif?t=1784638945\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734020/extras_big/bfe234f9c20fd9d663cedd4d25825513.webp?t=1784638945 width=1560 height=167 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory isn't just about finding the fastest line. It's about reading your rivals, choosing the right moment to attack, fighting for every position and taking risks that others won't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slam opponents aside, force mistakes, seize opportunities and deliver the perfect takedown. Every race unfolds differently, creating battles that last from the first corner to the finish line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734020/extras/3413920067e38618f51013963063723c.avif?t=1784638945\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734020/extras_big/3413920067e38618f51013963063723c.avif?t=1784638945 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734020/extras/0bf9255015f658c4f8686d419fea491e.avif?t=1784638945\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734020/extras_big/0bf9255015f658c4f8686d419fea491e.webp?t=1784638945 width=1560 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Heartbreak City. Every neighbourhood has its own character, and every road offers another opportunity to gain an advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through dense downtown streets. Test your speed on sweeping overhead freeways. Turn expansive airport runways and towering dockyards into giant playgrounds, then uncover hidden backroads full of daring shortcuts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you learn Heartbreak City, the more it gives back. Every shortcut discovered, every route mastered and every risk taken becomes another advantage when the battle begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734020/extras/8841116918727ea3a3cec789d645e177.avif?t=1784638945\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734020/extras_big/8841116918727ea3a3cec789d645e177.webp?t=1784638945 width=1560 height=167 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're battling for first place in a Race, surviving the chaos of Road Rage, hunting rivals in Marked Man, escaping Pursuits, mastering Blackspots, conquering Wreckonings or becoming the last car standing in Eliminators, there's always another way to prove yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into your favourite events, discover new ones as you explore, or  create and share your own experiences with Live Mix. However you choose to play, Heartbreak City is yours to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734020/extras/56d7260f218b0341a229ac6c36859c07.avif?t=1784638945\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734020/extras_big/56d7260f218b0341a229ac6c36859c07.webp?t=1784638945 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wreckreation 2 is an open-world arcade racing game where every Slam, every Shortcut and every Takedown can change the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734020/extras/bfe234f9c20fd9d663cedd4d25825513.avif?t=1784638945\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734020/extras_big/bfe234f9c20fd9d663cedd4d25825513.webp?t=1784638945 width=1560 height=167 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory isn't just about finding the fastest line. It's about reading your rivals, choosing the right moment to attack, fighting for every position and taking risks that others won't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slam opponents aside, force mistakes, seize opportunities and deliver the perfect takedown. Every race unfolds differently, creating battles that last from the first corner to the finish line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734020/extras/3413920067e38618f51013963063723c.avif?t=1784638945\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734020/extras_big/3413920067e38618f51013963063723c.avif?t=1784638945 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734020/extras/0bf9255015f658